{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "https://excalidraw.com",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "box_git_detect",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_git_detect",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "1. Git変更検知 (POST /git/files)\n- .step / .stp を自動検出\n- kind: '3d' を付与\n- HEADと作業ツリーの有無を判定\n- UIリストに ' / 3D CAD' 表示",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_1",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 105,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [60, 0]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_api_extract",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_api_extract",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 375,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "2. バイナリ抽出 (POST /git/3d/jobs)\n- HEAD側: git show HEAD:<path>\n- 作業ツリー: ローカル実ファイル\n- mesh_job_manager へ投入\n- 202 Accepted (job_id 即時返却)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_2",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 105,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [60, 0]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_process_mesh",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_process_mesh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 715,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "3. 子プロセス非同期差分計算\n- OCPによる新旧テッセレーション\n- トリム付きICPによる位置合わせ\n- マルチコア並列最短距離計算\n- VDM1バイナリ出力 & 完了",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_3",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_ui_render",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_ui_render",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 375,
      "y": 235,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "4. Web UI 表示 (ThreeDiffViewer in Git Tab)\n- ポーリング完了後、VDM1メッシュをWebGLへロード\n- Git 3D バッジ: 'HEAD:<head_path> ↔ <path>' 表示\n- 重ね表示 (Overlay) / 左右並べ (Side-by-Side) で赤・緑の色分け表示\n- スライダーリアルタイムしきい値更新 (60fps)\n- スマート寸法 (φ/R/直線/C)、注記メモ、中実ハッチング断面表示に完全対応",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    }
  ]
}
